      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS JACK HIGH (1) was safely held last time finishing a 9 length fifth at Gosford (30.30) but back to the scene of her latest victory. Returns to favourable track. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from four starts. Can atone. MISTRESS MAYHEM (2) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (31.13) at Lithgow behind Zipping Hamilton in a Mix. Has the pace to be prominent. Hard to beat again. MAJOR IMPACT (3) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Big Town Tilly (30.05) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Leading player again. SAINT RICO (8) is always a threat when he draws this box.",
